WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:03,290
Boss, the weekly business is now stable.

2
00:00:03,290 --> 00:00:06,090
Why did we suddenly decide to sign most industries back to China?

3
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:11,210
Some things cannot be solved by escaping

4
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:28,640
Still angry

5
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:30,840
The fish didn't get any snacks last night

6
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:33,040
You can't sleep in the middle of the night. This is for you.

7
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:36,500
Brother, after the two opposite families unite,

8
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,100
Our business has been adjusted too much

9
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:40,100
I usually sell at least thirty bottles of coffee in the morning.

10
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,100
There are only seventeen bottles today. No need.
